      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 / POST /v1/withdrawals/{id}/cancel（规划）\n认证租户/作用域；持久幂等\n返回 cancellation_requested / 当前 version\n不能把 API 响应当作已取消或退款",
      "originalText": "1 / POST /v1/withdrawals/{id}/cancel（规划）\n认证租户/作用域；持久幂等\n返回 cancellation_requested / 当前 version\n不能把 API 响应当作已取消或退款",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-05-cancellation-api",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
