      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2 / PG 取消事务（规划）\n永久关闭此经济业务再次签名 gate\n保留现有 Hold / Permit / tx family 证据\n生成取消 Outbox；不删除付款历史",
      "originalText": "2 / PG 取消事务（规划）\n永久关闭此经济业务再次签名 gate\n保留现有 Hold / Permit / tx family 证据\n生成取消 Outbox；不删除付款历史",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-05-cancellation-gate",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
