      "text": "3 / 审计授权与请求状态（规划）\nAUTHORIZATION_POSSIBLE / SIGNING_POSSIBLE\n签名超时也按可能发生处理\n查询具体 Treasury.requestStatus(requestId)",
      "originalText": "3 / 审计授权与请求状态（规划）\nAUTHORIZATION_POSSIBLE / SIGNING_POSSIBLE\n签名超时也按可能发生处理\n查询具体 Treasury.requestStatus(requestId)",
