      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2963492,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guardian / Council / Timelock 提交\nTreasury.cancelWithdrawal(requestId)\n底层 cancelOperation：Unused → Cancelled\n已 Executed 则拒绝；Cancelled 可幂等重放\n付款和取消谁先在链上执行决定结果",
      "originalText": "Guardian / Council / Timelock 提交\nTreasury.cancelWithdrawal(requestId)\n底层 cancelOperation：Unused → Cancelled\n已 Executed 则拒绝；Cancelled 可幂等重放\n付款和取消谁先在链上执行决定结果",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-05-cancellation-submit",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
