      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-05-cancellation-note0-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 309.95,
      "y": 1483.75,
      "width": 620.1,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2794538,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "以下都不是安全退款证明：\n• EOA nonce 替换屏障已最终上链（内层 Permit 仍可被其他交易提交）。\n• 外层交易未广播 / RPC 不存在 / 交易 revert / Relayer 已轮换。\n• 服务器时钟超过 deadline / 仅本地写 CANCELLED。\n这些事实可能只结束一次尝试，无法证明经济业务永久不可付款。",
      "originalText": "以下都不是安全退款证明：\n• EOA nonce 替换屏障已最终上链（内层 Permit 仍可被其他交易提交）。\n• 外层交易未广播 / RPC 不存在 / 交易 revert / Relayer 已轮换。\n• 服务器时钟超过 deadline / 仅本地写 CANCELLED。\n这些事实可能只结束一次尝试，无法证明经济业务永久不可付款。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-05-cancellation-note0",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-05-cancellation-note1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2311951,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-05-cancellation-note1-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-05-cancellation-note1-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1509.5,
      "y": 1483.75,
      "width": 621.0,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2795509,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "备选终结证明：授权过期或 epoch 已最终撤销。\n需最终链时间越过 deadline 或最终控制状态生效；\n全部可执行授权域/版本与执行记录覆盖完整，且无已付款事实。\n优先使用按 requestId 永久链上撤销作为证明。\n换 Treasury 前必须先在旧域最终终结未付款订单，去重映射不会自动迁移。",
      "originalText": "备选终结证明：授权过期或 epoch 已最终撤销。\n需最终链时间越过 deadline 或最终控制状态生效；\n全部可执行授权域/版本与执行记录覆盖完整，且无已付款事实。\n优先使用按 requestId 永久链上撤销作为证明。\n换 Treasury 前必须先在旧域最终终结未付款订单，去重映射不会自动迁移。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-05-cancellation-note1",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
